## 14. SEO Notes and Guardrails

### Claims to Use
- Workout tracking app
- Gym workout logger
- Readiness and progress dashboard
- Nutrition target tracking
- Calendar-based workout history
- Estimated 1RM trends
- Next-session load targets
- Optional AI coaching copy
- Optional Google activity sync

### Claims to Avoid Unless Product Scope Changes
- Medical-grade readiness analysis
- Guaranteed muscle growth
- Fully automated personal training
- Certified nutrition coaching
- Social fitness network
- Real-time wearable sync beyond supported activity data
- Multi-user coaching platform

### Recommended Tone
Clear, motivating, practical, and data-informed. PumpMe should sound like a focused training companion rather than a generic wellness app.
